AgentArk SimpleAgent

The independent SimpleAgent context runtime, message types/encoding, model
adapters and controlled file-tool registry are adapted from the Apache-2.0
ArkArena Python SDK (P90-RushB/ArkArena, ark_arena.harness), with the project
owner's authorization. They are maintained as AgentArk-owned Python 3.10
modules and do not depend on ArkArena or its runtime protocol.

XiaomiMiMo/mimoagent and SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent were consulted for the
separation of agents, model backends and tool definitions. This implementation
does not import those projects or include their shell tools.
